T1  - Q-learning-driven adaptive rewiring for cooperative control in heterogeneous networks
AU  - Weng, Yi-Ning
AU  - Lee, Hsuan-Wei
JO  - Engineering Applications of Artificial Intelligence
VL  - 169
SP  - 114024
PY  - 2026
DA  - 2026/04/01/
SN  - 0952-1976
